{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2022-06-21 07:50:00', 'title': 'SIMON® ANNOUNCES NEW, INNOVATIVE PRODUCT SEARCH PLATFORM', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , JUNE 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SIMON® IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THE LAUNCH OF SIMON SEARCH™, A NEW AND INNOVATIVE SEARCH PLATFORM DESIGNED TO ENHANCE THE SHOPPING EXPERIENCE BY GIVING SHOPPERS THE ABILITY TO RESEARCH IN-STOCK PRODUCTS AVAILABLE AT PARTICIPATING RETAILERS LOCATED WITHIN A SIMON PROPERTY. SIMON SEARCH IS AVAILABLE TO MILLIONS OF SHOPPERS THROUGH THE SIMON APP, PROPERTY WEBSITES, AND INTERACTIVE DIRECTORIES LOCATED AT SIMON PROPERTIES NATIONWIDE.'}